The cover images in assets/images/ that _data/covers.yml lists are James Webb
Space Telescope images from ESA/Webb (https://esawebb.org), cropped and
resized (including their -960 and -1280 copies), and licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). _data/covers.yml gives each
one's source and credit.
